    "headline": "Eaton Reports Record Second Quarter 2026 Results, with Strong Organic Growth, Accelerating Orders and Backlog, and Raises Organic Growth Guidance",
    "summary": "DUBLIN, July 31, 2026--Intelligent power management company Eaton Corporation plc (NYSE:ETN) today announced that second quarter 2026 earnings per share were $2.11. Excluding charges of $0.50 per share related to intangible amortization, $0.49 per share related to acquisitions and divestitures, and $0.05 per share related to a multi-year restructuring program, adjusted earnings per share were $3.15, a second quarter record.",
